<title>USA: Indium Corp raises price by $20/kilo from April 7.</title>
<headline>Indium Corp raises price by $20/kilo from April 7.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indium Corp of America said its indium list price will be raised by $20 to $335.00 a kilo or $10.42 a troy ounce, effective April 7.</p>
<p>Arconium announced earlier this week that it raised its published price to $10.11 per troy ounce, effective April 1, up from $8.10 set on March 19.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
